        "original_id": "6289419d-69a8-5543-a8e3-02e89c76e5b9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Television series: House of Anubis, Het Huis Anubis, Hannah-Oke\n- People: Brad Kavanagh, Nicki Chapman, Jason Gardiner\n- Companies: Nickelodeon, Disney Channel UK\n- Places: Whitehaven, Cumbria, UK\n- Roles: Fabian Rutter\n\nFacts:\n- Het Huis Anubis first aired in September 2006.\n- Het Huis Anubis broadcast its last episode on December 4, 2009.\n- House of Anubis is a mystery television series developed for Nickelodeon based on the Dutch-Belgian television series Het Huis Anubis.\n- Brad Lewis Kavanagh was born on 21 August 1992.\n- Brad Lewis Kavanagh is an English actor and singer-songwriter from Whitehaven, Cumbria.\n- Brad Kavanagh is best known for playing Fabian Rutter in the Nickelodeon TV series House of Anubis.\n- Hannah-Oke features six families from across the UK competing in singing challenges and karaoke sing-offs.\n- Hannah-Oke has a judging panel consisting of Disney Channel UK star Brad Kavanagh, Pop Idol participant Nicki Chapman, and Dancing on Ice participant Jason Gardiner.",
